# power and toughness 0/1 until end of turn (CR 611.2a, 613.4b): its colors and creature types are replaced and its card types
# kept (CR 205.1a, 105.3). Nothing else is drawn. At Bot2's next turn it is a 1/1 colorless Construct again.

